Underlying Federal Data Note:
State annual mean wage figures for Occupation Code 47-0000 (Construction and Extraction Occupations) are derived from the U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics (BLS) Occupational Employment and Wage Statistics (OEWS), May 2025 release (public domain U.S. government data). The compiled dataset structure, remodeling benchmark synthesis, labor-weighted sensitivity factors, and documentation are licensed under CC BY 4.0.
